WEBVTT

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.580
"Ikebukuro Station East Exit"

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:38.830
The great thing about <i>takoyaki</i>
is not just that it tastes good.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.950
It's that it's street food.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:44.540
When everyone shares the dish,
it closes the gap between them.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.910
You don't need a telephoto lens.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:50.910
For a street photographer,
it makes for the perfect shot.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:57.080
You've taken plenty of fuzzy shots after
going gaga over piping-hot <i>takoyaki</i>, Tom.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.040
That's what makes them real.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.910
Yeah...

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.950
The chewy texture of the octopus...

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.950
...gives me the feeling that
I'm eating a real live creature.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:13.330
Just like a fossil gives me the feeling
I'm looking at an ancient dinosaur...

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:20.250
"This is the prologue, the first step of it all"
"And if you don't take it,
you're never gonna make it"

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.000
"4:10 PM"

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.450
What?!

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.870
What the hell's going on?

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:34.750
We've been waiting here for so long,
and Big Bro still hasn't shown up!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.790
Saburo!

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:39.080
You did tell him about
today's meeting, didn't you?!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.160
Once after dinner at 8:15 PM.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:45.540
Once before bedtime at 11:45 PM.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.370
Once before school at 8:00 AM.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:53.080
And once during lunch at 12:50 PM,
I sent him emails.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.450
He replied to all of them.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:58.540
The problem's with
your feeling, man. Your spirit.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:04.870
It doesn't matter how often you
contact him if your soul's not reaching him.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:10.040
I do a better job of communicating
with Brother Ichi than you do, at least.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:14.450
Communication's not a matter of quantity!

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.830
Me? I'd do it in one stroke!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.290
Like this: "See you at the East Exit!"

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.660
Wha--?! How stupid could you be?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.500
Th-This is the West Exit!

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.000
Huh? What did I say just now?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.450
West Exit? East Exit? Huh? That's messed up.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.540
Your brain is what's messed up!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.080
--What the hell did you say?
--How stupid could you be?
Don't you have any sense of direction?!

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.200
Shut up! You're the stupid one!

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.580
--Grrr! Huh?!
--Listen up!

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.790
Heh hehehe!

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:49.080
Say, aren't you... Oh, I remember now!

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:53.330
You're the guy who tried to ambush us
but got whupped by Big Bro instead...

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.370
Sadamezuka, the leader of the Tenderloins!

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.120
That's right. I'm Sadamezuka.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.830
Written with the characters for "fate"
and "mound" and pronounced "Sa-da-me-zu-ka."

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:08.540
The fate between us is still undecided.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.870
But as long as the Buster Bros!!!
is short Ichiro-- Hey guys, listen up!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.580
--First of all, you act like such a smartass!
--Fate is on our side!

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.330
I'm sick of you pulling rank!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.660
Damn it! Don't you fuck with me!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:23.290
Let's give it to 'em, Tenderloins!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.750
So, you wanna fight, huh?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:31.160
Trying to beat us with sheer numbers
when Brother Ichi isn't around...

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.580
That's so fucking lame!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.200
So it's lame, I don't much care.
In love and war, all is fair.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.910
In deciding the victor, history does not err.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:41.080
I'll show you just how tough we are.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.500
Huh?!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.160
Who's the idiot that can't take a hint?

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.620
Who the fuck is it?

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:00.750
Why didn't you switch your phone to manner mode?

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:06.160
It's one of you guys that's lacking in manners.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.700
Right, Jiro?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.790
--Oh, it's me!
--So it's you, huh?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.040
Oh! Big Bro!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.200
And he fucking answers it!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:16.830
Weren't we supposed to meet at 4:00 PM
at our regular hangout near the East Exit?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:19.790
Sorry! It was the West Exit...

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.120
I messed up...

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.330
All right, no worries.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.200
I'm headed your way now!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.620
--Shit!
--Ehhh?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.290
Sounds kind of noisy over there.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:36.410
Yep, it sure is. Those guys from last time
have come to pay their respects, you see.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.450
Oh, yeah?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.700
Well then, I guess I'll have to say hello.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.790
OK, leave it to me!

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.250
I-Ichiro Yamada!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.370
Hey there, my audience! Lemme sock it to ya!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:59.250
Oh, my! It's Ichiro!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.250
Good luck!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.830
♬ My name is Ichiro and you better know my steelo ♬

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.330
♬ This is the prologue, the first step of it all ♬

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.080
♬ And if you don't take it,
you're never gonna make it ♬

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.200
♬ I'm the number one player,
takin' out all the haters ♬

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.540
♬ Get in my way and
you better expect some payback ♬

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.250
♬ We are the dream team
and our name is the Buster (Bros!) ♬

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.790
♬ Like some scrubs could
take out the reps of Ikebukuro? ♬

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.450
♬ Bring it on, fake rappers,
don't expect no sympathy ♬

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.120
♬ Lemme show you what I got, no goin' easy ♬

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.160
♬ It ain't my style to beat up on little guys ♬

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.290
--♬ I'm only interested in
cutting big ones down to size ♬

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.750
--Isn't that--?
--♬ I'm only interested in
cutting big ones down to size ♬

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.370
--He's headed for Nishiguchi Park.
--♬ Nothing'll ever heal these aching scars ♬

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:37.160
--Come on, Iris, Rex, let's go!
--♬ Nothing'll ever heal these aching scars ♬

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.660
--Come on, Iris, Rex, let's go!
--♬ From the day they tried
to tear us brothers apart ♬

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:42.370
♬ One for the show and two for my bros ♬

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:45.290
♬ Three for the hood where we all show ♬

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.790
♬ My name is Ichiro, and just this once I'll go ♬

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.370
♬ Pleased to meet ya. Rep Buster Bros, yo ♬

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.080
♬ ONE--Who's the one true rapper? ♬

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.660
♬ TWO--Rule the world, I'm the leader ♬

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.620
♬ THREE--Come on, say my name louder ♬

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.200
♬ My name is Ichiro, Big Bro in the house, yo ♬

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.830
♬ This is the legendary hypnosis MIC ♬

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.500
♬ A new age of hip-hop has arrived ♬

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.250
♬ Think you can keep up? Hands in the air yo ♬

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.500
♬ Tell me, who's the one? You know it's Ichiro ♬

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:19.950
Now that it's come down to this,
we better finish them off before Ichiro gets here!

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.250
--Big Bro!
--Brother Ichi!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.290
"Ichiro Yamada"

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.120
"Jiro Yamada"

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.540
"Saburo Yamada"

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.120
All right, give us your best shot!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.250
Gyahhh!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:50.250
H-Hey, you guys, don't run off! Stop!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.040
I just wanted to teach them a lesson,
but instead it turned into the real deal.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.700
That's one of the major contenders
in the upcoming Division Battle.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:08.080
Ichiro Yamada and his brothers
Jiro and Saburo of the Buster Bros!!!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.910
"Yorozuya Yamada"

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.120
Well now, this free kick
is the perfect opportunity.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:02.160
If they can pull it off, they'll have
a shot at turning this game around...

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.540
They pulled it off!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.620
Goal!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.870
Fucking awesome!
He shot a knuckleball, man! A knuckleball!

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:14.370
Oh, yeah? Well, I guess you know
your soccer since you play it yourself.

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.910
Is it really that special?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.370
Of course it is!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.200
A knuckleball's...

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.120
Well, suddenly the ball goes sailing by,
the goalie runs after it,

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.370
something magical happens,
and the crowd goes wild!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:31.620
In other words, not putting any spin
on the ball will cause its trajectory

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:34.830
to vary irregularly, making it a shot
that's hard for the goalie to deal with.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.790
Yeah, yeah. What you said.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:41.250
You totally didn't know that.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.250
Huh?!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.950
Hey, that's Brother Ichi's mic!

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:51.200
Hehe. I was just taking good care of it.
I thought it'd make Big Bro happy.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:59.950
In the Ikebukuro Division,
if you don't finish them, they'll finish you.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.870
In that case, you better
get them before they get you.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:09.500
It's a town where shady punks,
their eyes gleaming, struggle to survive.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.160
Welcome to 'bukuro, the town I love.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.910
You can bring it on,
but you better watch your back.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.660
Here you go.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.660
You must have gone to a lot of trouble for this.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:32.370
Thanks so much for getting this back.

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.580
You're such a dear.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.040
Here's something for your trouble.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.700
Don't worry, it's all there.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.040
And...

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.410
Huh?

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.410
Bon appétit!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.450
It's a token of my appreciation.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.410
There's no way I could eat this crap...

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.580
I should give them a call...

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.700
Freeze!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.500
--What the--?!
--Nobody makes a fuckin' move!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.120
Don't come any closer.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.580
It's not my fault if anything happens to her.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.580
An illegal mic...

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.580
You've got nowhere to run.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.370
Just drop the mic and turn yourself in!

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.950
Tee hehehehe.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.250
Take a look at this!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:24.540
You know what'll happen if they get
struck by the vibes from all these mics.

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:25.830
Holy shit!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.870
All of you are my hostages!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.870
You'll do exactly what I say!

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.120
Talk about bad timing...

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.290
Gemmill, the captain, comes around from outside.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.580
He keeps on going.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.410
He's aiming for the goal. He shoots.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.330
He scores!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.870
All right! They turned it around!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.040
Hey, what the hell do you think you're doing!

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.160
This is Brother Ichi's cherished mic.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.290
I'm gonna give it another good cleaning...

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:03.500
Hey, are you saying you don't trust me?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:07.700
My trust for you bottomed out
a long time ago, Jiro.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.000
We interrupt this program
for a special news bulletin.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:09.620
"News Flash: Man Barricades
Himself in Ikebukuro Café"

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:09.620
We interrupt this program
for a special news bulletin.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.580
"News Flash: Man Barricades
Himself in Ikebukuro Café"

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:13.580
Today around 11:30 AM,
a robber ran off with 100 million yen in cash

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:13.700
Today around 11:30 AM,
a robber ran off with 100 million yen in cash

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.250
--from the Kitamura Bank in Ikebukuro
and has barricaded himself in a nearby café.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.160
--Ikebukuro?!
--from the Kitamura Bank in Ikebukuro
and has barricaded himself in a nearby café.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.330
--Oh! It's Big Bro!
--from the Kitamura Bank in Ikebukuro
and has barricaded himself in a nearby café.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.660
--Oh! It's Big Bro!
--It appears he has taken
the customers hostage.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.000
--Oh!
--The suspect is carrying a large number
of illegally made hypnosis mics...

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.370
--The suspect is carrying a large number
of illegally made hypnosis mics...

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.790
--Say, isn't one of the people
they showed inside the café...
--The suspect is carrying a large number
of illegally made hypnosis mics...

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.330
--Say, isn't one of the people
they showed inside the café...
--...and has taken
the café's customers hostage.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.950
...that guy from Buster Bros!!!?

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.910
Ichiro Yamada!

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.290
Shouldn't we let Dr. Jinguji know?

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:43.660
--Why?
--Because he and Ichiro
used to be teammates. So...

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:44.830
Oh.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.000
You're right.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.700
Knowing Dr. Jinguji,
he might have some good advice.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.540
"Shinjuku Central Hospital"

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.910
I see, so that's what happened...

00:12:55.910 --> 00:13:00.450
But knowing Ichiro, he can find
a good way out of his predicament.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:04.290
He'll be fine. You needn't worry.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.950
"Matenro"

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.950
Huh?

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:25.250
Yes! I've successfully gained access
to Brother Ichi's smartphone.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.120
So, what's it look like in there?

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.080
Ummm...

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.370
--Damn!
--Looks like we don't got a choice.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.540
Let's move it and get our butts over there.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.790
Yeah!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:43.700
Hey, this is the Ikebukuro
bank robber on the line.

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.250
Get me the guy in charge.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.790
I'm the man in charge.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:54.910
Hey, hasn't one of your guys told you
my demands? Take a good look at this.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.660
Don't you give a shit about
what happens to these hostages?

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.160
I'll say it again!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.830
Make sure I get to the airport in one piece.

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.040
Hold on!

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.330
We need to make the necessary preparations.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.870
Just give us a little more time!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.700
Well then, pick up the pace!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.160
And don't even think
about tryin' anything funny!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:15.200
You guys ain't got no other options!

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.950
It figures it'd be too hard to
break through this to get to the robber.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.750
We've gotta get this mic to Big Bro somehow.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:32.410
First I gotta see what's going on in there...

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.790
Oh!

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.370
"Yorozuya Yamada"

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:43.790
Yes! I'm in!

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.120
What?

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.000
Big Bro!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.330
Brother Ichi...

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.580
OK, now what do we do?

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:56.750
What's with the holdup?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.620
Takin' your sweet ass time!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.910
You better not be doin' this on purpose!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.330
Mommy...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.870
It'll be all right...

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.080
Don't worry, kid!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.450
Huh?

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:07.910
Oh, it's Ichiro!

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.910
I'm here.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:12.580
I'll get us out of this somehow.
You can count on it!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:17.330
I can't wait that long!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.450
I'll make an example of them
one by one to show you I mean business!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.580
Hey, I told you not to move!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:27.580
Why don't you make an example out of me first?

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:30.580
Hey, you're that guy from Buster Bros!!!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.580
Don't you get it?

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:36.540
I've got a shitload of hypnosis mics on me.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.410
So what if you're Ichiro Yamada?
They'll be scrapin' you off the pavement

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.910
once I'm through with you!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.660
Someone like you couldn't handle all those mics.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.450
Just go ahead and turn yourself in!

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:45.910
You crack me up!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.910
All right then, I'll give you what you want...

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:50.250
A good ass-kickin'!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.790
♬ What's up you punk ♬

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.500
♬ You're nothing but a prisoner ♬

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.500
♬ My vibes have no limiter ♬

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.500
♬ I'll crush you to bits as my finisher ♬

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:10.200
How d'ya like dem apples,
you fuckin' wack bastard?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.080
Owww!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.540
Guess I'm screwed without a mic.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.790
Now what do I do?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.330
Huh?!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.000
Oh!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.080
Brother Ichi!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:33.120
Damn it! How dare he do that to Big Bro!

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:34.450
Jiro, wait!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.580
--I can't do that!
--Just hold up a sec...

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.370
Huh? What's the matter?

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.370
Brother Ichi's looking at something.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.750
You're watching me, aren't you, Saburo?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:57.660
Knowing you, you can
figure out what I'm getting at.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.040
Oh!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.040
Jiro! Around back!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.160
Yeah, we can give Big Bro
his mic from back there!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.700
Leave it to me!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:37.750
Can't get enough of these vibes!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:41.080
You still got a problem with me?
Well, all right...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.040
I'll give you another earful
of my dynamite flow.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.330
You're all out of breath.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.870
Rapping with all of those mics will drain you...

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:54.620
...psychologically. You'll fucking die.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.200
You fuckin' wack bastard!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.040
You're the one that's gonna die!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.040
♬ Wipe that grin off your face ♬

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.910
♬ We're here to put you in your place ♬

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.750
♬ The trigger that's been pulled ♬

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.080
♬ Can't be nulled ♬

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.950
♬ You're the one to die ♬

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.950
♬ Pour one out for the good guy ♬

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:13.620
♬ Crucified as a sacrifice ♬

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:15.700
♬ Swagger after your demise ♬

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.160
♬ Go to hell! ♬

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:23.160
Gwahhhh!

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:32.250
Lemme tell you something... Mics...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:37.660
...aren't tools to hurt people
or to be used in crimes!

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:41.910
Huh?!

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.660
--Big Bro!
--Catch!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:58.950
Heh!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.950
Feel my soul, you bastard!

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.950
♬ Top runners of this city, on your feet! ♬

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.700
♬ The Buster Bros!!! are on the beat ♬

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.450
♬ Call us the wack job busters,
cleaning the streets ♬

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.160
♬ (Bros! Bros!) We run this city ♬

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.290
♬ (We run this city) ♬

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.540
♬ Don't stop moving forward ♬

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.120
♬ We'll wipe out all who stand against us ♬

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.120
♬ This is our city, 'bukuro city ♬

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.410
♬ Busting through town (We run this city) ♬

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.200
--Big Bro!
--Brother Ichi!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.580
Guys!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.540
Sorry, it was my fault...

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.450
You did a great job of cleaning my mic.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.830
Big Bro...

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.250
And you, Saburo.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.700
You did a great job figuring it out.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.660
That's because you gave me a sign, Brother Ichi.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.160
Don't you fuck with me!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.290
Let's make some noise!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.160
♬ The watchdog of the Buster Bros!!! ♬

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.040
♬ I hate losing, so I'm prepared
for any threat posed ♬

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.290
♬ If this is where you wanna
throw your weight around ♬

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.830
♬ First you're gonna have to take me down ♬

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.830
♬ Not interested in your dog-crap burns ♬

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.700
♬ No one gets through
without some backbone earned ♬

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.450
♬ Like three-headed Cerberus ♬

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:05.370
♬ Mess with me and
I'll send you flying off the precipice ♬

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.200
♬ Don't underestimate the bonds we've built ♬

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.080
♬ I'd rather kill than chill
when I got skills this ill ♬

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.950
♬ Punishment without an ounce of hesitation ♬

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.950
♬ East side, west side,
no boundaries to this operation ♬

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.700
♬ We give it our all: one shot,
one kill, that's the drill ♬

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.700
♬ Run away and there's no tomorrow to fulfill ♬

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.500
♬ Battle's most rewarding
when you defeat the strong ♬

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.830
♬ Today's haters will become
tomorrow's trash before long ♬

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:24.160
♬ Cleaning up this town
with a little trash-talking ♬

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:27.830
♬ Making friends and holding hands while walking? ♬

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.790
♬ Heck no!
My hand is for holding a microphone ♬

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.580
♬ Try and best me, nobodies! I'm a Don ♬

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.330
♬ Looks like you got a towel to throw ♬

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.370
♬ Yamada Bros patrolling Ikebukuro ♬

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.450
♬ Top runners of this city, on your feet! ♬

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.160
♬ The Buster Bros!!! are on the beat ♬

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:40.950
♬ Call us the wack job busters,
cleaning the streets ♬

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.620
♬ (Bros! Bros!) We run this city ♬

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:43.790
♬ (We run this city) ♬

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:44.950
♬ Don't stop moving forward ♬

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.660
♬ We'll wipe out all who stand against us ♬

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:48.540
♬ This is our city, 'bukuro city ♬

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.160
♬ Busting through town
(We run this city) ♬

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:20.200
Hey, out of our way.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:22.830
Tom, there's a spot for you here.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.580
Thanks.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.500
These guys...

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.450
I can't take my eyes off them!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:41.700
That was a great shot, wasn't it?

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.620
I knew it the moment I kicked the ball.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:47.080
My feelings reached you, Big Bro!

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:51.450
You knew I hacked into the café's
security camera, didn't you, Brother Ichi?

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:55.290
We pulled it off because
of Brother Ichi's faith in me!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.620
--No, it was because of me--
--It was because of me--

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.370
It was the three of us.

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.870
The three of us are Buster Bros!!!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:14.370
OK, what'll we have for dinner tonight?

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:16.410
Today it's gotta be simmered mackerel
with miso, Brother Ichi's favorite.

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:18.660
But I think curry is still an option.

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.950
I really wanted to say pasta pescatore,
but I held myself back.
